{
  "name": "Life Manager - AI Task Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Task Assistant (Phase 1)\nWebhook -> Validate -> AI Classification -> Switch -> Action -> Respond.\n\n**MVP:** returns structured task JSON only. Nothing is written to the Life Manager database (`created` is always false).\n\n**Setup:** select your own OpenAI credential on the 'OpenAI Chat Model' node. Before exposing the webhook publicly, add Header Auth on the Webhook node.\n\n**Later (phase 2):** insert an HTTP Request node between each action node and 'Respond: Success' to call a secured Life Manager endpoint.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "task-assistant",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "7c1f2a3e-5b6d-4e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Input validation: body must be an object with a non-empty string `message` (max 500 chars).\nconst MAX_LENGTH = 500;\nconst body = $input.first().json.body;\nconst raw = body && typeof body === 'object' ? body.message : undefined;\n\nif (typeof raw !== 'string') {\n  return [{ json: { valid: false, message: null, error: '`message` must be a string.' } }];\n}\n\nconst message = raw.trim();\nif (message.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { valid: false, message: null, error: '`message` must not be empty.' } }];\n}\nif (message.length > MAX_LENGTH) {\n  return [{ json: { valid: false, message: null, error: '`message` must be at most ' + MAX_LENGTH + ' characters.' } }];\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { valid: true, message, error: null } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
